# Lucy Burton, Terra Vitae. A2 "Tags": JobAccepted(tags), tag_returned, tag_sold, lied_to_lucy, lucy_knows.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('lucy_knows')
goto: Knows

cond: HasFlag('tag_returned')
goto: Grateful

cond: HasFlag('lied_to_lucy')
goto: StillLooking

cond: HasItem('burton_dog_tag')
goto: HasTag

cond: HasFlag('tag_sold') && HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)')
goto: AfterSale

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (A woman in a hand-knitted shawl, a photo of a young man pinned to it.) You're not one of ours. Are you hungry?
#
o_text: Who's the boy in the photo?
o_id: ask_photo
o_goto: Burton
#
o_text: Just passing through.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Burton
npc: Burton. My son. He was outside the wall when EBI sealed the south gate for the cleansing.
+ They never brought the bodies in. They just... left them, between the airlocks and the dust.
+ He wore his father's dog tag. I want it back. I can pay a hundred. It's all we have.
#
o_text: I'll bring it to you.
o_id: accept_tags
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: I'm sorry. I can't.
o_id: decline_tags
o_goto: Exit

name: Accepted
npc: The gate captain won't let anyone near them. He says it's evidence. Evidence of what, he never says.
+ (She presses your hand.) Thank you.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(tags)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Did you see him? Is he... still there?
#
o_text: Not yet. I'm working on it.
o_id: not_yet
o_goto: Exit

name: HasTag
npc: (She sees the chain in your hand before you say anything.)
#
o_text: (Give her the tag.) He was easy to find. He's at peace.
o_id: give_tag
o_goto: Returned
#
o_text: I looked. He wasn't there.
o_id: lie_tag
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Believes
o_fail: SeesThrough
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: has_tag_leave
o_goto: Exit

name: AfterSale
npc: Did you see him? Is he... still there?
#
o_text: I looked. He wasn't there.
o_id: lie_after_sale
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Believes
o_fail: SeesThrough
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: after_sale_leave
o_goto: Exit

name: Returned
npc: (She holds it against her cheek for a long time.) Here. A hundred. And you eat with us whenever you're on this side of town. Father Olaf will hear of this.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'burton_dog_tag')
effect: PlayerAddGold(100)
effect: SetFlag('tag_returned')
effect: SetFlag('terra_vitae_friend')
#
o_text: Take care, Lucy.
o_id: returned_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Believes
npc: (She nods slowly.) Then the dust has him. Maybe that's better. Thank you for looking.
effect: SetFlag('lied_to_lucy')
effect: EndConversation

name: SeesThrough
npc: (Her eyes go to your pocket, then back to your face.) Richard Shaw has a new piece in his window. A dog tag. BURTON, L.
+ Get out. Everyone here will know what you are.
effect: SetFlag('lucy_knows')
effect: SetFlag('terra_vitae_cold')
effect: EndConversation

name: Grateful
npc: (She is wearing the tag.) There's soup. There's always soup for you.
#
o_text: Thanks, Lucy.
o_id: grateful_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: StillLooking
npc: (She is looking south through a window that doesn't face south.) Hello again.
#
o_text: Take care.
o_id: still_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Knows
npc: (She turns her back on you.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Exit
npc: Go gently.
effect: EndConversation
